5,1,1,talk,May,,I am tired of guessing who cleans up after the last person to leave.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,The noise from that room is constant. I need to know what is actually happening in there.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must consider the hidden costs of time. Who is really paying for this mess?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to see the numbers. I hate signing things without knowing the real price.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"We are all sitting right next to each other, but we barely talk. That feels wrong.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, is it just noise, or is it the mess too?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
