35,2,1,talk,May,,"The tally shows two people used it eleven times, the rest only four.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Misaki,,The wall is thin. I can hear every word from my desk.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Servas,,"We paid 68,000 yen for outside hire. That is a lot for small groups.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"The kitchen fit-out is 96,000 yen. The meeting space is 141,000.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The last awkward talk happened across the desks. Everyone heard it.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, if the wall is that thin, a quiet room is impossible.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, exactly. Sound travels. We need to stop the noise at the source.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Sakura, the meeting space is more expensive, but it might save us the hire fees.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Servas, yes, but the kitchen is cheaper. I need to weigh the lunch time.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@May, the fridge clear-out was a mess. Half the food was nobody's.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,May,,I don't want to be the one cleaning up after strangers.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Misaki,,I need a room where I can actually rest without hearing the office.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Servas,,We are paying for space we don't use well. Let's fix that.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Sakura,,The lunch trip takes twenty-five minutes. That is a lot of lost time.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,We need a place to talk without the whole office listening.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
